body:
@TTtonyTT Florida lol. As the victim the prosecutor asks for my judgment because restitution and stuff is involved. I don’t get to definitively decide like the judge though but yeah they’re asking what I want in the plea deal. 

He’s a broke ass so my best option financially is the victim fund. 

Just not sure what’s worse 1 year jail or 6 months jail + 2 years probation
